---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'August 26, 2026';
const contactEmail = 'hello@startinvestingsimple.com';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Important disclaimer: Start Investing Simple provides educational content only and does not offer personalized financial, investment, tax, or legal advice."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-a:text-brand prose-strong:text-paper">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: {lastUpdated}</em></p>

    <h2>No Financial Advice</h2>
    <p>
      The content on Start Investing Simple ("the Site") is for general informational and educational purposes
      only. It is not intended to be, and should not be construed as, personalized financial, investment, tax,
      legal, or accounting advice. We are not licensed financial advisors, brokers, or tax professionals.
    </p>

    <h2>No Guarantees</h2>
    <p>
      Investing involves risk, including the potential loss of principal. Past performance is not indicative of
      future results. Any examples, figures, or calculators provided on this Site (including our tools and
      calculators) are for illustrative purposes only and should not be relied upon as a prediction of actual
      investment results.
    </p>

    <h2>Do Your Own Research</h2>
    <p>
      Before making any financial decision, we strongly encourage you to conduct your own research and consult
      with a qualified, licensed financial advisor, accountant, or attorney who understands your individual
      circumstances.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy of Information</h2>
    <p>
      We work to keep our content accurate and up to date, but financial rules, tax laws, and market conditions
      change frequently. We make no representations or warranties about the completeness, accuracy, or reliability
      of any information on this Site.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on this Site may be affiliate links, meaning we may earn a commission if you click through and
      make a purchase or sign up for a service, at no additional cost to you. We only recommend products or
      services we believe may be useful to our readers. This does not influence the editorial content we publish.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      This Site may display advertisements served by third parties, including Google AdSense. We do not
      necessarily endorse the products or services advertised on this Site.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this disclaimer? Reach out at <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
